entries[139014] = { ["name"] = "Wild Gladiator's Ringmail Kilt", ["text"] = "Warlords Season 2\nBinds when picked up\nLegs Mail\n10 Armor\n+5 [Agility or Intellect]\n+7 Stamina\n+ 5 Critical Strike\n+ 5 Haste\nDurability 120 / 120\nClasses: Shaman\nRequires any Alliance race\nGladiator's Wartide (0/5)\nGladiator's Ringmail Armor\nGladiator's Ringmail Helm\nGladiator's Ringmail Gauntlets\nGladiator's Ringmail Spaulders\nGladiator's Ringmail Leggings\nLegacy Set: Bonus is inactive\n(2) Set Elemental: Reduces the cooldown of Hex by 15 sec.\n(2) Set Enhancement: When you activate Feral Spirits, the duration of incoming crowd control effects is reduced by 25% for 30 sec.\n(2) Set Restoration: When you dispel a harmful Magic or Curse effect from an ally, they gain 150 Versatility for 10 sec.\n(4) Set Elemental: For 15 sec following the summon of an Elemental, you are immune to silence and interupt effects.\n(4) Set Enhancement: Windfury now deals damage 2 extra times.\n(4) Set Restoration: When the target of your Riptide effect drops below 50% health, the duration is refreshed.\nSell Price:" }
