entries[139698] = { ["name"] = "Farseer's Harness", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nChest Mail\n12 Armor\n+5 [Agility or Intellect]\n+7 Stamina\n+ 3 Versatility\n+ 7 Mastery\nDurability 140 / 140\nClasses: Shaman\nComplete your Class Order Campaign.\n\nRaiment of the Farseer (0/8)\nFarseer's Harness\nFarseer's Footwraps\nFarseer's Gauntlets\nFarseer's Mask\nFarseer's Leggings\nFarseer's Shoulderguards\nFarseer's Belt\nFarseer's Wristwraps\nLegacy Set: Bonus is inactive\n(2) Set : Increases your out-of-combat regeneration in outdoor Broken Isles zones.\n(4) Set : While you are below 35% health you take 50% reduced damage in outdoor Broken Isles zones.\n(6) Set Elemental: Intellect increased by 18 . (6) Set Restoration: Intellect increased by 18 .\n(6) Set Enhancement: Agility increased by 18 .\n(8) Set Enhancement: Lightning Bolt, Stormstrike, and Healing Wave have a chance to increase your Critical Strike by 71 for 12 sec.\nSell Price:" }
